OL,3,GNEWSALuton Big Weekend park gets
OL,4,Alicence for more events
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has approved a licence for an
OL,7,Fannual three-day entertainment event at
OL,8,Fa venue that previously hosted Radio
OL,9,F1's Big Weekend.
OL,11,FLuton Borough Council itself applied
OL,12,Ffor a licence to hold events at
OL,13,FStockwood Park no more than once a
OL,14,Fyear, with live music and alcohol
OL,15,Fsales.
OL,17,FIn 2024, Raye, Coldplay and Chase &
OL,18,FStatus headlined a three-day event
OL,19,Forganised by BBC Radio 1 and Festival
OL,20,FRepublic.
